,{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスでもお芝居でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージに立って表現してるときが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番自分を解放できて楽しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その瞬間だけスイッチ入れてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは大体寝るかもぐもぐするだけの人生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、外見てないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い天気ですね！！！(適当)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から名古屋公演よろしくね～(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆ"}],"source":"archive"}